OL,3,GEast                                   
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMilder  
OL,6,Fthan previous days, with cloudy        
OL,7,Fperiods on Sunday. Cool with sunny     
OL,8,Fspells on Monday. Cloudier and         
OL,9,Fbreezier by Tuesday, with outbreaks of 
OL,10,Frain spreading across the west.        
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
